### ============================================================
### 🧾 SALES — DISEÑO NUEVO (ticket con múltiples productos)
### ============================================================

### 0. Ver turno activo (verifica antes de vender que haya uno abierto)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cash-registers/active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 0.1 Abrir turno (solo si no hay uno activo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/cash-registers/open
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "opening_cash": 500.00
}

### Obtener ventas
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1. Crear venta — UN solo producto, pago 100% efectivo
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "products": [
    { "product_id": 11, "quantity": 2, "sale_unit_type": "unit" }
  ],
  "client_id": null,
  "payment_method": "cash",
  "cash_amount": 98.00,
  "card_amount": 0
}

### 2. Crear venta — VARIOS productos, pago 100% tarjeta
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "products": [
    { "product_id": 6, "quantity": 1, "sale_unit_type": "unit" },
    { "product_id": 12, "quantity": 1, "sale_unit_type": "unit" }
  ],
  "client_id": null,
  "payment_method": "card",
  "cash_amount": 8.00,
  "card_amount": 90.00
}

### 3. Crear venta — VARIOS productos, pago MIXTO (efectivo + tarjeta)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "products": [
    { "product_id": 6, "quantity": 1, "sale_unit_type": "unit" },
    { "product_id": 12, "quantity": 1, "sale_unit_type": "unit" }
  ],
  "client_id": null,
  "payment_method": "mixed",
  "cash_amount": 40.00,
  "card_amount": 24.00
}

### 4. Intentar vender con pago insuficiente (debe rechazar con 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "products": [
    { "product_id": 6, "quantity": 5, "sale_unit_type": "unit" }
  ],
  "client_id": null,
  "payment_method": "cash",
  "cash_amount": 5.00,
  "card_amount": 0
}

### 5. Intentar vender más stock del disponible (debe rechazar con 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "products": [
    { "product_id": 6, "quantity": 9999, "sale_unit_type": "unit" }
  ],
  "client_id": null,
  "payment_method": "cash",
  "cash_amount": 999999,
  "card_amount": 0
}

### Ver una venta (usa un ID real que te haya devuelto el paso 1, 2 o 3)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Actualizar una venta — cambiar de producto (más barato, genera cambio)
### Usa el ID de una línea real de la venta del paso 1
PUT {{baseUrl}}/sales/21
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "product_id": 10,
  "quantity": 1
}

### 7. Actualizar una venta — cambiar por producto MÁS CARO sin pagar la diferencia (debe rechazar con 422)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/sales/25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "product_id": 20,
  "quantity": 1
}

### 8. Actualizar una venta — cambiar por producto MÁS CARO, cubriendo la diferencia
PUT {{baseUrl}}/sales/25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "product_id": 13,
  "quantity": 2,
  "additional_cash": 20.00,
  "additional_card": 50.00
}

### Cancelar UNA sola línea de venta
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales/17/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Intentar cancelar la misma línea otra vez (debe rechazar con 400, "ya está cancelada")
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales/17/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Revertir cancelación (solo Administrador)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales/25/revert
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 9. Cancelar el TICKET COMPLETO
### copia el "sale_group_id" que te devolvió el paso 3 y pégalo aquí abajo
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales/group/91f99b7e-9038-4ce8-82b5-033be9a1a701/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 10. Intentar cancelar el mismo grupo otra vez (debe reportar líneas ya canceladas, no fallar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales/group/91f99b7e-9038-4ce8-82b5-033be9a1a701/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Eliminar una venta (verifica que si estaba cancelada, NO duplique el stock)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/sales/17
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json




