### ============================================================
### 📝 SUPPLIER NOTES (Notas de Trato)
### ============================================================

### Obtener todas las notas
GET {{baseUrl}}/supplier-notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear una nota de trato
POST {{baseUrl}}/supplier-notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "supplier_id": 1,
  "total_amount": 500.00,
  "delivery_date": "2026-08-15",
  "reminders": "Llamar antes de entregar",
  "products": [
    {
      "product_id": 6,
      "quantity_agreed": 10,
      "price_agreed": 12.50,
      "discount": 0,
      "is_gift": false
    }
  ]
}

### Ver una nota
GET {{baseUrl}}/supplier-notes/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actualizar una nota
PUT {{baseUrl}}/supplier-notes/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "supplier_id": 1,
  "total_amount": 500.00,
  "delivery_date": "2026-08-15",
  "reminders": "Actualizado",
  "status": "pending"
}

### Intentar editar una nota YA confirmada cambiando el status directo (debe rechazar con 400)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/supplier-notes/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "supplier_id": 1,
  "total_amount": 999.00,
  "delivery_date": "2026-08-20",
  "reminders": "Intento de bypass",
  "status": "confirmed"
}

### Editar una nota que SÍ está pendiente (debe funcionar)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/supplier-notes/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "supplier_id": 1,
  "total_amount": 550.00,
  "delivery_date": "2026-08-16",
  "reminders": "Actualizado correctamente"
}
### Eliminar una nota
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/supplier-notes/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Escanear ticket con claude
POST {{baseUrl}}/supplier-notes/3/scan
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="ticket.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./ticket.jpeg
--boundary--

### Confirmar entrada (actualiza stock)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/supplier-notes/2/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "products": [
    { "product_id": 6, "quantity_received": 10 }
  ]
}

### Registrar pago
PUT {{baseUrl}}/supplier-notes/3/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Confirmar nota con observaciones
PUT {{baseUrl}}/supplier-notes/8/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "products": [
    { "product_id": 6, "quantity_received": 8 }
  ],
  "observations": "El proveedor solo trajo 8 de los 10 acordados, dijo que no tenía existencia y que completa la próxima semana."
}

### Verificar el historial
GET {{baseUrl}}/supplier-notes/historial
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Probar duplicados (debe rechazar con 422)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/supplier-notes/6/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "products": [
    { "product_id": 6, "quantity_received": 5 },
    { "product_id": 6, "quantity_received": 3 }
  ]
}

